    "title": {
      "rendered": "Pleased to meet you"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<div id=\"profile_photo\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-187 size-thumbnail\" src=\"https://pikilon.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/pikilon_francisco_gutierrez-231x256.jpg\" alt=\"pikilon_francisco_gutierrez\" width=\"231\" height=\"256\" srcset=\"https://pikilon.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/pikilon_francisco_gutierrez-231x256.jpg 231w, https://pikilon.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/pikilon_francisco_gutierrez-461x512.jpg 461w, https://pikilon.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/pikilon_francisco_gutierrez-115x128.jpg 115w, https://pikilon.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/pikilon_francisco_gutierrez.jpg 538w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 231px) 100vw, 231px\" /></div>\n<p>It was about time to have my professional portfolio and here it is.</p>\n<p>I created this site as a way to promote my work and share tricks I learned. I am a developer so <strong>this site will be focused on performance, usability and readability.</strong></p>\n<p>I&#8217;ve been a web developer for 17 years and I want to share with you some <strong><a href=\"https://pikilon.com/category/code/\">code</a></strong> I found useful and some <strong><a href=\"https://pikilon.com/category/imho/\">opinions</a></strong> about web news (my blog). My fields of expertise are HTML, CSS, Javascript and Php. I also have video producing/editing knowledge because I studied and worked in that for a long time.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I&#8217;ve just finished my Higher National Diploma (<strong>HND</strong>) in <strong>Web Application Development</strong> with <strong>First Class Honors</strong> in a record time.</p>\n<p>I do freelancing projects so if you like what you see and want to hire me feel free to contact me:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>[email]pikilon@gmail.com[/email]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/piki.g.saraza\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/nomaspatanes\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://plus.google.com/+pikilon\" target=\"_blank\">Google+</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "rendered": "<p>It was about time to have my professional portfolio and here it is. I created this site as a way to promote my work and share tricks I learned. I am a developer so this site will be focused on performance, usability and readability. I&#8217;ve been a web developer for 17 years and I want to share &hellip; </p>\n<p class=\"link-more\"><a href=\"https://pikilon.com/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> &#8220;Pleased to meet you&#8221;</span></a></p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
